<title>PORTUGAL: Sonae Industria says not behind stock move.</title>
<headline>Sonae Industria says not behind stock move.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>A spokesman for Sonae Industria said that heavy trade, amounting to some 2.8 pct of its capital, had nothing to do with any shuffling of holdings by the company itself.</p>
<p>&quot;The company has nothing to do with the transaction. If it had, it would have had to inform the bourse (authority),&quot; the spokesman told Reuters.</p>
<p>Sonae Industria stock was up 1.2 percent in trade of some 388,000 shares. The bulk of the shares was dealt in a single 326,000 block at 1,345 in the pre-opening session.</p>
<p>--Paula Cordeiro, Lisbon bureau 3511-3113125</p>
